{"nodeId":140180901,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2990284866,"text":"へへっ…あたしの考えすぎだったみたいね。こうなったら一刻も早く立ち直って、より頼りになる存在にならなくちゃ。","nextNodeIds":[140180902]},{"nodeId":140180902,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":311318362,"text":"思い返せば、今日は恥ずかしいとこばっかり見せちゃったね…あはは。","nextNodeIds":[140180903,140180907,140180912]},{"nodeId":140180903,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2927510602,"text":"みんなのプレゼントについて…","nextNodeIds":[140180904]},{"nodeId":140180904,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":1662129730,"text":"他の人は当たり前に持ってるものなのに、自分はどうしても手に入れられないものって、誰にでもあるでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[140180905]},{"nodeId":140180905,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2647520362,"text":"あたしにとっては、家族が全員揃った記念写真がそういうものだったんだ。小さい頃からずっと、憧れてた…","nextNodeIds":[140180906]},{"nodeId":140180906,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2658545842,"text":"それをまさか、こんな形で叶えてもらえるなんて…へへ、あたしも、たまにはツイてることもあるみたい。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":140180907,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":602089570,"text":"クレメンタインについて…","nextNodeIds":[140180908]},{"nodeId":140180908,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2720278266,"text":"昔から思ってた…あたしが楽しく生きられるようにってママは願ってたけど、実際それはそれで、かなり大きい期待なんじゃないかなって…もしかしたらパパのよりも、応えるのが難しいかもってね。","nextNodeIds":[140180909]},{"nodeId":140180909,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":1610655634,"text":"表に出てた性格は全然違うように見えて、二人は心の底からお互いを認め合ってたんだと思う。","nextNodeIds":[140180910]},{"nodeId":140180910,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2095120266,"text":"巡水船はフォンテーヌ全体に利益をもたらす大掛かりなプロジェクトだから、「家族」の目線から考えたり、評価したりはしづらかったんだろうなって。","nextNodeIds":[140180911]},{"nodeId":140180911,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":3843172338,"text":"だからママはパパを止めなかったのかもね。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":140180912,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3699565234,"text":"「相棒だと思ってくれてる？」について…","nextNodeIds":[140180913]},{"nodeId":140180913,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":870574554,"text":"ちょっとちょっと、何で急にあたしの真似なんかするわけ！？ダメダメ、それ以上言わないで！本気で恥ずかしいんだから！","nextNodeIds":[140180914]},{"nodeId":140180914,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":564370338,"text":"さっさと忘れて！今すぐ忘れなさい！あっ…いやでも、完全に忘れられたらちょっと困るかも…","nextNodeIds":[140180915]},{"nodeId":140180915,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":3040931730,"text":"と·に·か·く！心の奥底にしまって、もう二度と掘り返さないでちょうだい！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,80],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"[3_340300264:2843.193,398.092,4163.716,0.000,74.657,0.000]"},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1401801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[1401809],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","count":12},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":3}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":0,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","